	linkml:default_prefix "fix_orchestra" ;
	linkml:default_range <https://w3id.org/lmodel/fix-orchestra/string> ;
	linkml:description "A LinkML model of FIX Orchestra, the FIX Trading Community's standard for rules of engagement that a machine can read. It renders two editions from their XSDs, the v1.0 Technical Standard and the v1.1 third release candidate, so that an Orchestra repository or interfaces file of either edition converts to records that validate here." ;
